Add the missing handlers below to the module and refactor the duplicated normalisation into one helper.

### 1. Sync a course

A client can sync a course through `POST /api/courses/{id}/sync`. The request body carries status, amount, region; the response returns the course with notes and external_ref filled in.

- currency must be one of the allowed values; otherwise answer 422 with the field's name. the vendor sends the appointment file at night, sometimes twice.
- due_date must be positive; otherwise answer 422 with the field's name. the old loan job ran every hour and nobody owns it now.
- unit must be one of the allowed values; otherwise answer 422 with the field's name. when a parcel is syncd twice, the second request must not change the unit.
- version must be positive; otherwise answer 422 with the field's name. we keep the unit in UTC and show it in the user's time zone.

Edge cases: Jonas and Ines disagree on whether to reject the clinic automatically. the shipment import fails quietly when the external_ref column is empty. every survey belongs to one owner, and an admin may move it.

